oodborne illness\nRoad maintenance\nView all\nVisit\nCounty parks\nGovernment buildings\nSomeone in jail\nView all\nThe Olmsted County budget: A careful planning process\nAs we approach year-end, many organizations, including Olmsted County, are preparing their budgets for the upcoming calendar year. Over the next several weeks, we will share more information about the Olmsted County budget to help inform and engage you, our residents.\nReminder: Second half 2026 property tax payments due October 15\nThe second half of 2026 real and personal property tax payments are due October 15. Learn about payment options, important mailing reminders and how to avoid late fees and penalties.\nView all news\nUpcoming Events\nGraham Park events\nPark events\nPublic meetings\nWas this helpful?\nYes\nNo\nExtra feedback\nSend feedback\nResidents\nBusiness\nGovernment\nI Want To\nI Want To\nApply\nPay\nObtain\nReport\nSubscribe\nVisit\nSearch\nFacebook\nInstagram\nLinkedIn\nNextdoor\nYouTube\nMaps & Directions\nContact Us\nAccessibility & Translation\nSalary Compliance\nPrivacy Policy and Disclaimer\nComprehensive Civil Rights Plan\nHIPAA Notice of Privacy Practices\nGreater Minnesota Transportation Sales and Use Tax\nLocal Option Sales and Use Tax\nPosting on website policy\nCopyright © 2026 Olmsted County, Minnesota",
